From e1207143644b2fb5c7308271363dd9bad6b7f2ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Faris Hijazi <theefaris@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 01:11:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(fleet): show external sessions' own title, machine and
 status

Discovery now records the owner's live activity on the external session
identity, follows the owner's title on existing threads until someone renames
the thread in T3, and the sidebar and thread panel show the machine the
session runs on instead of the T3 environment that discovered it.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_20cc9c1a6a80484ca54b4895500b171c
